# NOTE — /ai-builder asset caching
# A Cache-Control rule for /ai-builder/* is accepted here but NOT applied:
# production keeps serving the stylesheet with `max-age=14400` whatever the
# pattern depth (wildcard or exact path, all verified). Cache-Control for that
# route is pinned upstream of this file.
#
# The page therefore busts its own cache: index.html links fonts.css, style.css
# and main.js as ?v=<md5 of those three files>. Bump that hash whenever any of
# them changes — that, not this file, is what keeps markup and CSS in step.

/assets/js/consultation-modal.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/admin/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive

/foundingtalent-survey
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
